      "It is useful after resizing a photo, when a scan looks gentle, or when a screenshot of text appears a touch fuzzy. Sharpening is an illusion of detail rather than a recovery of it, so the tool is best used lightly and judged at full size. Knowing how the maths works helps you avoid the harsh halos that overdone sharpening creates.",
